Visual template provenance:
templates/visual-template.html is a sanitized implementation based on a
personally designed resume webpage. It extracts general visual characteristics
from that personal design and removes personal and identifying content. No
third-party logos, images, personal information, or media files are intentionally
bundled.

Fonts and offline behavior:
The HTML templates reference locally installed font families and system font
fallbacks only. No font files, external font stylesheets, or scripts are bundled
or requested by the template, so generated resumes can be read and printed offline.

All people, companies, projects, metrics, contact details, and job postings in
examples/ are fictional and provided only for demonstration. Any resemblance to
real persons or organizations is coincidental. Never replace them with real
personal data in a public commit.
